SATQ("d3f7c429",{"q":"<p class=\"mfigp\"><img class=\"mfig\" alt=\"Figure\" width=\"622\" height=\"639\" style=\"width:28.97em\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><\/p><p>The graph of a system of an absolute value function and a linear function is shown. What is the solution <svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 23.2 11.51\" style=\"width:2.81em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G2\" transform=\"translate(3.81 3.69) scale(0.0535)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(10.57 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G10\" transform=\"translate(14.74 3.69) scale(0.0696)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(20.31 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg> to this system of two equations?<\/p>","c":{"A":"<p><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 30.9 11.51\" style=\"width:3.75em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G6\" transform=\"translate(4.1 5.54) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#G0\" transform=\"translate(12.82 1.28) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(18.17 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G14\" transform=\"translate(22.56 1.28) scale(0.074)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(28.01 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg><\/p>","B":"<p><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.53 11.51\" style=\"width:2.73em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#Ge\" transform=\"translate(3.92 1.28) scale(0.074)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(9.8 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G3\" transform=\"translate(13.96 1.16) scale(0.0728)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(19.65 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg><\/p>","C":"<p><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.53 11.51\" style=\"width:2.73em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G0\" transform=\"translate(4.45 1.28) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(9.8 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G14\" transform=\"translate(14.19 1.28) scale(0.074)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(19.65 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg><\/p>","D":"<p><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.53 11.51\" style=\"width:2.73em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.44em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G3\" transform=\"translate(3.8 1.16) scale(0.0728)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(9.8 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G1\" transform=\"translate(14.18 1.28) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(19.65 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg><\/p>"},"r":"<p>Choice C is correct. The solution to the system of two equations corresponds to the point where the graphs of the equations intersect. The graphs of the linear function and the absolute value function shown intersect at the point <span class=\"nw\"><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.53 11.51\" style=\"width:2.73em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G0\" transform=\"translate(4.45 1.28) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(9.8 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G14\" transform=\"translate(14.19 1.28) scale(0.074)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(19.65 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg>.<\/span> Thus, the solution to the system is <span class=\"nw\"><svg class=\"mx\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.53 11.51\" style=\"width:2.73em;height:1.4em;vertical-align:-0.35em\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"expression\"><use href=\"#Gb\" transform=\"translate(0.4 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><use href=\"#G0\" transform=\"translate(4.45 1.28) scale(0.0716)\"/><use href=\"#G12\" transform=\"translate(9.8 7.3) scale(0.0322)\"/><use href=\"#G14\" transform=\"translate(14.19 1.28) scale(0.074)\"/><use href=\"#Gc\" transform=\"translate(19.65 0.4) scale(0.1071)\"/><\/svg>.<\/span><\/p><p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.<\/p><p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the y-intercept of the graph of the linear function.<\/p><p>Choice D is incorrect. This is the vertex of the graph of the absolute value function.<\/p>"});
